SUMMARY:Part Closure: WEAVER LINE: Saturday 19 and Sunday 20 September\, no
  service between Hackney Downs and Cheshunt / Enfield Town. Use London 
 Underground connections between Central London and Seven Sisters\, and 
 Clapton for Rectory Road. Replacement buses operate. The limited number of
  GREATER ANGLIA and STANSTED EXPRESS trains which usually serve Seven 
 Sisters stop at Tottenham Hale instead.
